ttps://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk53/seasons/383defe6-d3bb-4df2-8782-56ae3fea75aa.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk48/seasons/ac22771c-b21b-4c6a-ba88-7ffa12cfe92c.jpeg","likes":168,"dislikes":5,"views":17947,"release_date":"1587427200000","season_number":1,"description":"Muey is a young girl who lived with her mother, who has a very close friend.  Muey also has a crush on Thien who is the son of her mother's close friend. Although Muey loves him, Thien never seems to love Muey, instead, he always teases her, messes with her, and sometimes bullies her. Muey never got angry or responded to Thien when she got bullied because she loved him too much. One day, Thien was forced to marry Muey just to get rid of the wife of a powerful man. As Thien never looked at Muey as his life partner, he was not really okay with the marriage. In addition, Thien wanted a perfect woman as his wife, but Muey was never perfect in his eye. Will  Thien fall in love with Muey at the end?  Will Muey be the perfect wife for him?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.4}],"value":8.4,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":2605,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}